  "answer_text": "Here is an overview of the **Georgia Department of Revenue \u2013 Motor Vehicle Division (MVD) Tag Renewal Portal** at **mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx**:\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\ude97 Georgia MVD Online Tag Renewal Portal\n\nThis is the **official online vehicle tag (registration) renewal website** for the State of Georgia, operated by the **Georgia Department of Revenue (DOR)**.\n\n### What You Can Do on This Site:\n\nGeorgia MVD offers online applications and information regarding **tag renewals, license plates, titles, dealer registrations, and commercial vehicles**.\n\nSpecifically, on the tag renewal portal, you can:\n\n- **Renew your vehicle registration/tag** online\n- **Obtain or retrieve your Renewal Identification Number (RIN)** by visiting the site and selecting \"Obtain/Retrieve a RIN,\" then entering your plate number, name, and address.\n- **Find your tag renewal fee.**\n- **Complete the Title and Registration application** before visiting your local county tag office.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd11 What is a RIN?\n\nA **RIN (Renewal Identification Number)** is a **12-digit number** necessary for online renewals. It is typically found on your renewal notice mailed to you.\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 Tips for Online Renewal:\n\n- If the address on your Renewal Notice is **not correct**, do **not** renew online. You must also present your **driver's license or Georgia ID** to renew.\n- After vehicle registration, you will receive a **license plate with a decal which must be renewed each year**.\n- Georgia offers **hundreds of specialty plate designs** to choose from, including veterans, colleges, special interest groups, and more.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udcde Contact & Verification:\n\n- The telephone number for MVD is **(855) 406-5221**.\n- Call **1-800-GEORGIA** to verify that a website is an official website of the State of Georgia.\n\n---\n\n> \ud83d\udd17 **Direct Link:** [https://mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx](https://mvd.dor.ga.gov/tags/index.aspx)\n> \ud83d\udd17 **Main DOR Motor Vehicles Page:** [https://dor.georgia.gov/motor-vehicles](https://dor.georgia.gov/motor-vehicles)\n\nWould you like help with a specific task, such as renewing your tag, finding a tag office, or looking up license plate options?",
